{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_0TSa0A9kYR11y9YeBaNBnesU","content":"1\t# kredito\n2\t\n3\tFlutter app (iOS + Android) for a consumer loan broker. The user registers\n4\twith an email and a phone number, picks the amount they want to borrow, accepts\n5\tthe terms and gets a list of offers from partner banks. Two screens so far:\n6\t`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart` and `lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`.\n7\t\n8\tAnalytics is PostHog (`posthog_flutter`), set up in `lib/analytics.dart` and\n9\t`lib/main.dart`; screen views come from `PosthogObserver`. We are on the\n10\tPostHog free tier. Product events are defined in `docs/EVENTS.md`; the\n11\tscreens do not send any of them yet. Send events through `Analytics.capture`\n12\tso the key and host stay in one place."}
